====================================================================================================
  G_eff/G (cosmic closure): z=0.0: 1.01397, z=0.5: 1.00967, z=1.0: 1.00615, z=1.5: 1.00390, z=2.0: 1.00255
      z       a      f(z)      D(z)  sigma8(z)   G_eff/G
